{"id":1160202,"chapter_id":1160202,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"　　钟柜，雕塑，火焰，人质……\n　　你感受到赤红的悲剧在一寸寸渗透，女孩在啜泣，致命的危险在火海里徘徊，步步逼近……\n　　这又是谁的梦境？","style":14,"background":503,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202002,"trial_step":2,"drawing":1160202},{"step":2,"content":"梦境中的细节异常模糊，你很难不联想到卡米利安在审查时说过的话——\n“如果你真的忘记了什么，欢迎来找我咨询~”","style":3,"background":503,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1160202},{"step":3,"content":"直觉告诉你，醒来有必要去找卡米利安问个清楚。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1160202},{"step":4,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"我知道，你一定会来。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1160202},{"step":5,"content":"卡米利安从容地戴上<color=#e45515>眼镜</color>。即便被长期关在与世隔绝的禁闭室，她的状态似乎并没有受到影响。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1160202},{"step":6,"options":["你对我做了什么？","你怎么知道我会来？"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202007,"trial_step":7,"course":3,"drawing":1160202,"choices":[{"text":"你对我做了什么？","goto":8},{"text":"你怎么知道我会来？","goto":12}]},{"step":7,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"不是我做的，是局长阁下自己。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1160202},{"step":8,"content":"她收起微笑，露出了你从未见过的哀伤神情。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1160202},{"step":9,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"你的枷锁，在我们之间制造了某种联系。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1160202},{"step":10,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"我感觉到了，你进入了我的梦境。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1160202,"next":[15]},{"step":11,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"因为我看到了，你进入我的梦境。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1160202},{"step":12,"content":"她收起微笑，露出了你从未见过的哀伤神情。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1160202},{"step":13,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"想必是因为你的枷锁，在我们之间建立了某种联系。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1160202,"next":[15]},{"step":14,"options":["信任卡米利安","怀疑卡米利安"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202015,"trial_step":15,"course":3,"drawing":1160202,"choices":[{"text":"信任卡米利安","goto":16},{"text":"怀疑卡米利安","goto":18}]},{"step":15,"content":"她的神色不像是撒谎，你所看到的真的是卡米利安的过去？这与她的罪行会有什么关联吗？","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1160202},{"step":16,"content":"然而梦境残留的记忆太过模糊，你只记得一些碎片，关于钟柜、雕塑、和火焰，还不足以完全还原她的经历。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1160202,"next":[21]},{"step":17,"content":"你早在上次审查就预料到我会遗忘一些事情，这真的不是你有意安排的吗？","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1160202},{"step":18,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"我承认，我有时候是很喜欢跟局长开些小玩笑。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1160202},{"step":19,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"可是您不是好奇我觉醒为禁闭者的经历吗？难道您不想知道其中的关系吗？","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1160202,"next":[21]},{"step":20,"options":["试探追问"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202021,"trial_step":21,"course":3,"drawing":1160202,"choices":[{"text":"试探追问","goto":22}]},{"step":21,"content":"我记得梦境中见到了一个钟柜，那是你的东西吗？","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1160202},{"step":22,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"那是我父亲的一台老式报时钟。钟摆会发出沉闷的响声……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1160202},{"step":23,"content":"她的语气颇有些怀念，轻轻推了推<color=#e45515>眼镜</color>。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1160202},{"step":24,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"我的父母都是心理医生，但他们不希望我从事这个行业。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1160202},{"step":25,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"小时候，我躲在钟柜里，透过钟摆的缝隙，偷偷看他们如何给患者问诊。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1160202},{"step":26,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"对了，局长还记得梦境中书桌上的雕塑吗？","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1160202},{"step":27,"content":"是个三十公分左右高度的精致石像。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1160202},{"step":28,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"这是传说中的梦之神，可以让人陷入沉睡与甜梦。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1160202},{"step":29,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"庄严，圣洁，无瑕……我父母对自己的职业有极高的要求，所有的治疗都在梦之神的监督下进行。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1160202},{"step":30,"content":"听着卡米利安的描述，你总觉得她口中的钟柜、雕塑，和你梦境中所见的景象有些微妙的违和……","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1160202},{"step":31,"content":"像是在为你的不安做出解答般，她露出一丝苦笑。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1160202},{"step":32,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"可惜……有些患者不相信心理医生能替自己保守不堪的秘密。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1160202},{"step":33,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"我所说的这些，都毁在火海之中。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1160202},{"step":34,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"白色的大理石雕塑，变成砸向后脑勺的致命钝器；钟柜将我和父母、凶手、火海，隔绝至两个世界……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1160202},{"step":35,"content":"那些原本模糊的碎片，在卡米利安的引导拼凑成整体，一个新的画面在你脑中一闪而过——","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1160202},{"step":36,"content":"瘦削的男人，被绑在椅子上，所处的环境似乎是一间废弃仓库。","style":14,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1160202},{"step":37,"content":"你的梦里，除了这段经历，没有别的了吗？","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1160202},{"step":38,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"火舌起舞时我就会醒来……局长还是不相信我吗？","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1160202},{"step":39,"content":"她看上去并不知道这个男人的存在？","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1160202},{"step":40,"options":["如实转告","隐瞒所见"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202041,"trial_step":41,"course":3,"drawing":1160202,"choices":[{"text":"如实转告","goto":42},{"text":"隐瞒所见","goto":49}]},{"step":41,"content":"我在你的梦里还看见了不一样的信息。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1160202},{"step":42,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"是吗？我在烧起大火之后就会惊醒，不记得后面还有别的内容啊……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1160202},{"step":43,"content":"好像有个“人质”被绑在偏僻的地方……","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1160202},{"step":44,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"偏僻的地方……具体是指哪里呢？","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1160202},{"step":45,"content":"她的语气中似乎有些反常的兴奋。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1160202},{"step":46,"content":"我不记得了……怎么，这些内容对你很重要吗？","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1160202},{"step":47,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"当然重要，这可是我好不容易才帮局长回忆起来的……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1160202,"next":[54]},{"step":48,"content":"没什么，只是有些走神。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1160202},{"step":49,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"是吗？","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1160202},{"step":50,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"我还以为是局长终于回忆起关于“人质”的信息了~","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1160202},{"step":51,"content":"？！","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1160202},{"step":52,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"不应该啊，我这么“真诚”地帮局长还原记忆，难道还没有奏效吗？","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1160202,"next":[54]},{"step":53,"content":"什么意思？","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1160202},{"step":54,"content":"她只是微笑着，推了推<color=#e45515>眼镜</color>。镜片的反光不知为何格外刺眼，你感到一阵眩晕——","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1160202},{"step":55,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"你也很好奇，对不对？你看到的那个男人究竟是谁？他被绑在哪里？他为什么会出现在你的记忆中？","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1160202},{"step":56,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"相信我，照我说的做……我会让你想起来的……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1160202},{"step":57,"content":"你的眼皮不受控制地变得沉重，眼前卡米利安的脸开始变得模糊。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1160202},{"step":58,"options":["你在做什么？！"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202059,"trial_step":59,"course":3,"drawing":1160202},{"step":59,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"听话，睡一觉，就什么都想起来了——","style":11,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1160202},{"step":60,"content":"一晃白光闪过，你身处在一个陌生的环境。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1160202},{"step":61,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"局长阁下，欢迎来到你的潜意识世界~","style":11,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1160202},{"step":62,"content":"我的潜意识？我们不是在讨论你的梦境吗？","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1160202},{"step":63,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"别心急，现在揭晓答案还太早了。","style":11,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1160202},{"step":64,"content":"你四下张望，并看不见卡米利安的身影。\n施术者不知所云的声音只存在于你的脑海中，早已听不出先前的悲伤与怀恋。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1160202},{"step":65,"content":"就为了此刻能催眠我，你一直在演戏。","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1160202},{"step":66,"options":["你的目的究竟是什么？"],"style":6,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202067,"trial_step":67,"course":3,"drawing":1160202},{"step":67,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"嘘——我现在有正事要忙，还没有心情和您拌嘴。","style":11,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1160202},{"step":68,"content":"卡米利安话音刚落，黑暗中走出一名拄着手杖的女人。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1160202},{"step":69,"speaker":"？？","content":"即便你是MBCC局长，也不该滥用权利来到这里。","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1160202},{"step":70,"content":"她是谁？","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1160202},{"step":71,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"给我答案的人。","style":11,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1160202},{"step":72,"content":"你似乎也认识眼前的女人，但你无论如何都看不清她帽檐下的脸。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1160202},{"step":73,"options":["向眼前的女人求助","观察形势，尝试自救"],"style":6,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202074,"trial_step":74,"course":3,"drawing":1160202,"choices":[{"text":"向眼前的女人求助","goto":75},{"text":"观察形势，尝试自救","goto":77}]},{"step":74,"content":"你有太多问题需要解答——你是谁？这里是哪里？我该怎样脱离卡米利安的控制回到现实……","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1160202},{"step":75,"content":"可惜你还没来得及开口，催眠师的命令在你的脑海里率先响起。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1160202,"next":[79]},{"step":76,"content":"这间档案室文件摆放习惯让你很是熟悉，似乎和MBCC的文件收纳规则非常相似。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1160202},{"step":77,"content":"可惜你还没来得及进一步做出了解和判断，催眠师的命令在你的脑海里率先响起。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1160202,"next":[79]},{"step":78,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"局长，告诉这个多管闲事的女人，你是为了审查卡米利安，来调查“人质”下落的。","style":11,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1160202},{"step":79,"options":["按她说的做","反抗施术者的命令"],"style":6,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202080,"trial_step":80,"course":3,"drawing":1160202,"choices":[{"text":"按她说的做","goto":81},{"text":"反抗施术者的命令","goto":83}]},{"step":80,"content":"虽然不情愿，但你还是复述了卡米利安的话，毕竟这里是她的主场。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1160202},{"step":81,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"真乖~来，一起听听她都回答了什么？","style":11,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1160202,"next":[85]},{"step":82,"content":"你的反抗没有奏效，这里是卡米利安的主场。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1160202},{"step":83,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"乖~别白费力气了，不如还是一起听听她都回答了什么吧？","style":11,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1160202,"next":[85]},{"step":84,"speaker":"？？","content":"人质被关在新城边界的一个废弃的机关仓库，沿着锈河往南走就能找到。","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1160202},{"step":85,"content":"神秘人说着，将手中的文件递给你。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1160202},{"step":86,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"这女人的话不可信，还是再确认一眼为好~","style":11,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1160202},{"step":87,"content":"施术者对你施加了巨大的压力，你被迫低头，打开了手里的文档。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1160202},{"step":88,"content":"　　卡米利安，女，N.F.86年2月14日出生。班彦医学院心理学博士，现为9th特聘心理学顾问。\t\n　　特殊能力：篡改他人潜意识。\t\n　　档案：\n　　父戴恩·特修斯，母莉莉安·特修斯，均为班彦医学院毕业生，擅长潜意识治疗，于N.F.84年起开设私人心理诊所。\t\n　　N.F.96年，<color=#e45515>特修斯夫妇</color>遭到谋害，案件线索遭大火焚毁，其女卡米利安在钟柜被发现时已陷入昏迷。<color=#e45515>凶手和纵火嫌犯奥利司</color>为狄斯重要议员，最终因证据不足被释放。","style":10,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1160202},{"step":89,"content":"　　N.F.106年，凶手妻子、父母因不明原因主动与之割席。奥利司因失去妻子<color=#e45515>杰克诺尔家族</color>庇护被罢职，遭到议会驱逐。\t\n　　N.F.107年，9th在卡米利安私人诊所找到神志被控制的奥利司，<color=#e45515>将其作为人质秘密羁押，羁押地址为机关旧址仓库</color>。同年，卡米利安接受9th邀请，为其提供犯罪心理学指导。\t\n　　N.F.111年，杰克诺尔家族一干平民均出现幻视幻听等催眠后遗症状，疑似曾被<color=#e45515>篡改潜意识</color>。\t\n　　N.F.112年，卡米利安因涉嫌篡改潜意识被9th正式逮捕，转押至MBCC","style":10,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1160202},{"step":90,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"机关旧址仓库，很好……局长，你做得很好……","style":11,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1160202},{"step":91,"content":"卡米利安心满意足地重复着这个地址，声音越来越轻。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1160202},{"step":92,"options":["你要去哪里？","别走！放我出去！"],"style":6,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202093,"trial_step":93,"course":3,"drawing":1160202,"choices":[{"text":"你要去哪里？","goto":94},{"text":"别走！放我出去！","goto":94}]},{"step":93,"content":"无人回应，那个俯视着整个潜意识世界的声音完全没了动静。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1160202},{"step":94,"content":"卡米利安？","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1160202},{"step":95,"content":"快结束催眠。","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1160202},{"step":96,"content":"卡米利安！","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1160202},{"step":97,"speaker":"？？","content":"你认为她知道这个信息之后会做什么?","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1160202},{"step":98,"content":"？！\n你……你在跟我说话？","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1160202},{"step":99,"speaker":"？？","content":"这里只有我们两个人。","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1160202},{"step":100,"content":"你不是存在于潜意识的记忆吗？为什么能……","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1160202},{"step":101,"speaker":"？？","content":"回答我，你认为她的目的是什么？","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1160202},{"step":102,"content":"她的声音里有不可违抗的气势。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1160202},{"step":103,"options":["她会前往仓库找到人质","她会为父母复仇"],"jump":[104,104],"style":6,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202104,"trial_step":104,"course":3,"drawing":1160202},{"step":104,"content":"可我困在梦境里，要怎么出去阻止她？","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1160202},{"step":105,"content":"她并不像在直接回应你的提问，却像是预料到你的困惑般给了你解答。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1160202},{"step":106,"speaker":"？？","content":"做梦的不是她，而是你。","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1160202},{"step":107,"speaker":"？？","content":"催眠所见的景象，本就是对现实记忆的提取和加工。","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1160202},{"step":108,"content":"我还是不太明白……","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1160202},{"step":109,"speaker":"？？","content":"身在潜意识世界，你一定能找回那些被遗忘的东西。","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1160202},{"step":110,"content":"遗忘的东西？你究竟忘记了什么？","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1160202},{"step":111,"options":["努力回忆"],"style":6,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202112,"trial_step":112,"course":3,"drawing":1160202,"choices":[{"text":"努力回忆","goto":113}]},{"step":112,"speaker":"警卫","content":"局长，这么晚了，您不睡觉在这里做什么？吓我一跳。","style":1,"background":2001,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1160202},{"step":113,"content":"我有机密任务要做，需要去上级机密档案室申请浏览权限。","style":2,"background":2001,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1160202},{"step":114,"speaker":"警卫","content":"原来如此，我看到您半闭着眼睛，还以为您在梦游……需不需要通知夜莺副官？","style":1,"background":2001,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1160202},{"step":115,"content":"不用。我出门的事，对所有人都保密。","style":2,"background":2001,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1160202},{"step":116,"content":"这是你自己的记忆吗？你怎么完全没有印象……","style":3,"background":2001,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1160202},{"step":117,"options":["继续回忆"],"style":6,"background":2001,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202118,"trial_step":118,"course":3,"drawing":1160202,"choices":[{"text":"继续回忆","goto":119}]},{"step":118,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"局长会找机会独自去9th档案室，调查人质的下落……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1160202},{"step":119,"content":"好……我会去上级机关档案室，调查人质的下落……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1160202},{"step":120,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"你会忘记一些细节，把剩下的记忆碎片，当做与我精神连接的梦境……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1160202},{"step":121,"content":"我会忘记一些细节，把剩下的记忆碎片，当做与你精神连接的梦境……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1160202},{"step":122,"speaker":"卡米利安","content":"很好，接下来，你会看见夜莺进入审查室，你会被禁闭者们厌弃、责怪……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1160202},{"step":123,"speaker":"？？","content":"如果我猜得没错，她会骗你这一切都是梦。但其实你已经经历了。","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202125,"trial_step":125},{"step":124,"content":"是的……","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202126,"trial_step":126},{"step":125,"content":"更令你惶恐的是，她提到的每一个话题——精神连接、梦境、不愿意被审查、童年的噩梦，都是一种刻意的引导，每一个小动作都经过精心设计。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202127,"trial_step":127},{"step":126,"speaker":"？？","content":"如果是你的话，应该知道接下来要怎么做。","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202128,"trial_step":128},{"step":127,"content":"眼前的女人抬起手杖，敲了敲你手里的文件。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202129,"trial_step":129},{"step":128,"speaker":"？？","content":"离开前记得把档案留下。\n小心点，这可是开启危险大门的钥匙。","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202130,"trial_step":130},{"step":129,"content":"等等！","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202131,"trial_step":131},{"step":130,"content":"你仍有疑问没有得到解答——","style":1,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202132,"trial_step":132},{"step":131,"options":["她当初为什么没有杀了仇人","你是谁？为什么能与我对话？"],"style":6,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202133,"trial_step":133,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"她当初为什么没有杀了仇人","goto":134},{"text":"你是谁？为什么能与我对话？","goto":135}]},{"step":132,"content":"与其让奥利司落入9th手中作为把柄，大费周章地获取情报，为什么不在一开始就杀了仇人……","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202134,"trial_step":134,"next":[137]},{"step":133,"content":"既然卡米利安都无权看到这些文件，必须利用我才能知道这些信息，你又为什么会这么了解？","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202135,"trial_step":135},{"step":134,"content":"你不但了解卡米利安，你甚至很了解我？甚至像是预测到我会进入自己的回忆，留下这些话作为提醒。你究竟是……","style":2,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202136,"trial_step":136,"next":[137]},{"step":135,"content":"她没有回答你。","style":3,"background":1041,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202137,"trial_step":137},{"step":136,"content":"“咚——”","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202138,"trial_step":138},{"step":137,"content":"在手杖击打地面的声响后，又是一阵眩晕。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202139,"trial_step":139},{"step":138,"content":"你回到了禁闭室。果然，这里已经没有了卡米利安的影子。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202140,"trial_step":140},{"step":139,"options":["呼叫夜莺，缉拿禁闭者！"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202141,"trial_step":141,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"呼叫夜莺，缉拿禁闭者！","goto":142}]},{"step":140,"content":"夜莺！立刻派警卫队缉拿卡米利安，她逃走了。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202142,"trial_step":142},{"step":141,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"卡米利安？你们不是在禁闭室吗？","style":11,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202143,"trial_step":143},{"step":142,"content":"是我小看了她第一次的催眠。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202144,"trial_step":144},{"step":143,"content":"卡米利安异能的本质不是简单的催眠。而是对潜意识世界的扭曲和操控，对我下意识的行为甚至记忆都有扭曲的效果。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202145,"trial_step":145},{"step":144,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"可是您不是已经对她施加了枷锁，还没收了她的怀表……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202146,"trial_step":146},{"step":145,"content":"既然可以在你不知情时对你进行操纵和隐瞒，那解开枷锁、骗过MBCC所有守卫对她而言根本不是难事。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202147,"trial_step":147},{"step":146,"content":"而且，怀表并不是她唯一的催眠道具……你想起今天让你分外在意的那副金丝眼镜。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202148,"trial_step":148},{"step":147,"content":"该死……我现在没有时间跟你解释了！沿着锈河往南，卡米利安去了旧机关仓库！","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202149,"trial_step":149},{"step":148,"content":"9th不让她接触人质一定有他们的理由。快一点，我们要阻止她。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202150,"trial_step":150},{"step":149,"content":"卡米利安很有可能杀了人质，甚至……","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202151,"trial_step":151},{"step":150,"content":"甚至犯下你暂时无法揣测、也无法控制的恶行。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202152,"trial_step":152},{"step":151,"speaker":"兰利","content":"小心点，这可是开启危险大门的钥匙。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":260202153,"trial_step":153}]}